        --------
        Table (works similarly for RecordBatch)

        >>> import pyarrow as pa
        >>> import pandas as pd
        >>> df = pd.DataFrame({'n_legs': [2, 4, 5, 100],
        ...                    'animals': ["Flamingo", "Horse", "Brittle stars", "Centipede"]})
