        Examples
        --------
        >>> import pyarrow as pa
        >>> schema = pa.schema([
        ...     pa.field('n_legs', pa.int64()),
        ...     pa.field('animals', pa.string())])

        Write schema to Buffer:

        >>> schema.serialize()
        <pyarrow.Buffer address=0x... size=... is_cpu=True is_mutable=True>
